                "description_en": "Biography<br><br>Specializing in the algorithmic management of complex architectural processes, bridging the gap between design intent and engineering precision. Backed by extensive international experience in high-rise, healthcare, and industrial typologies, advanced technologies such as Python, Revit API, and Rhino.Inside are utilized to automate workflows, ensure data integrity, and deliver fabrication-ready (LOD 400) models. As a Managing Partner at Cosmos.Lab, he leads the digital infrastructure and operational delivery processes that enable the studio to manage large-scale projects internally, autonomously, and without error.<br><br>"
